    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">OUR PROCESS</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">From first conversation to first shipped order in 8 to 12 weeks.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Here is what working with our private label team actually looks like, step by step.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Start the Conversation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207762476,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">A clear, predictable path from concept to launch.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Most supplement brands hit the same delays: surprise compliance issues, formulation rework, packaging vendor handoff problems, fulfillment setup. Our process is built to remove every one of those friction points before they happen.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Here is the full timeline from your first call with us to the day your first private label order ships. Most brands move from label approval to product in-hand in 3 to 4 weeks. The total timeline from first conversation runs 8 to 12 weeks, with formulation and design work in the middle.</p>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207762477,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: white; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">The 6-step path from concept to launch</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 60px;\">8 to 12 weeks total. 3 to 4 of those weeks happen after your labels are approved. Each step has a clear owner, a clear deliverable, and a clear handoff so you always know where the project stands.</p>\n    <div style=\"position: relative;\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; top: 36px; left: 8%; right: 8%; height: 2px; background: #c9dbe2; z-index: 1;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;\"><path d=\"M15 19.13a9.38 9.38 0 0 1 6-2.18 9.38 9.38 0 0 1 6 2.18M15 19.13v-.41c0-.86-.16-1.69-.45-2.45M15 19.13v.13a1.62 1.62 0 0 1-1.6 1.62l-.55 0c-1.05-.05-2.1-.05-3.15 0l-.55 0a1.62 1.62 0 0 1-1.6-1.62v-.13m6.85-2.86a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-2.85-1.05c-1.07 0-2.07.38-2.85 1.05m5.7 0a4.49 4.49 0 0 1 1.4 2.45m-7.1-2.45a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-1.4 2.45m2.85-7.95a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm6 0a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 01</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 1</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Discovery Call</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">We learn your brand, audience, target categories, and timeline. You get a tailored product recommendation list and pricing.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;\"><path d=\"M9.75 3.1v5.66m4.5-5.66v5.66m-4.5 0a3.38 3.38 0 0 1-1.5 6.43m6-6.43a3.38 3.38 0 0 0 1.5 6.43M4.5 19.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5h6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5-4.5v-4.31a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5v4.31Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 02</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEKS 1-2</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Formula Selection</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Choose from our catalog or work with our formulators on a custom product. Lock specs, dosing, claims, and certifications.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;\"><path d=\"M19.5 14.25v-2.63c0-3.07-2.13-5.78-5.13-6.4-.62-.13-1.24-.25-1.87-.34V3.75A.75.75 0 0 0 11.75 3h-1.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75v1.13c-.63.09-1.25.2-1.87.34-3 .62-5.13 3.33-5.13 6.4V20.25M16.5 18.75h-9a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-3.75c0-3 1.92-5.62 4.75-6.45M9.75 9h4.5\"/><path d=\"M3.75 21h16.5M9 12h6m-6 3h6\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 03</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEKS 2-4</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Branding & Labels</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Our in-house design team creates your label, packaging, and box artwork. Two revisions included. Final files go to compliance review.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 04</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 4</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Compliance & QA</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">FDA-required labeling, claims substantiation, and supplement facts panel are reviewed and approved. Production-ready files locked. This is your label-approval gate.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;\"><path d=\"M21 7.5 12 12m0 0L3 7.5M12 12v9.75m0-9.75 9-4.5M3 7.5l9 4.5M3 7.5v9l9 4.5m9-13.5v9L12 21.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 05</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEKS 5-8</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Manufacturing</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Production runs in our FDA-registered, GMP-certified facility. Every batch goes through multi-stage quality testing before release.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;\"><path d=\"M8.25 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 1 1-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0ZM18.75 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 1 1-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0Z\"/><path d=\"m8.25 18.75 4-15a3 3 0 0 1 2.92-2.25h.83a3 3 0 0 1 2.92 2.25l4 15M3 5.25h2.16c.93 0 1.74.59 2.04 1.46l3.6 10.79M3 8.25h5M3 11.25h5M21 18.75v-3a3 3 0 0 0-3-3h-1.5a3 3 0 0 0-3 3\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 06</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEKS 8-12</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Fulfillment & Launch</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Inventory ships to your warehouse or we dropship direct to your customers. You launch the brand. We handle the operations.</p>\n    </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207762478,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #012638; padding: 70px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 40px;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0;\">3-4</p>\n      <p style=\"color: white; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 14px 0 0;\">Weeks from label approval</p>\n      <p style=\"color: white; opacity: .7; font-size: 13px; margin: 6px 0 0;\">To product in-hand and shipping</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0;\">8-12</p>\n      <p style=\"color: white; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 14px 0 0;\">Weeks total</p>\n      <p style=\"color: white; opacity: .7; font-size: 13px; margin: 6px 0 0;\">From first call to first shipped order</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0;\">250+</p>\n      <p style=\"color: white; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 14px 0 0;\">Ready formulations</p>\n      <p style=\"color: white; opacity: .7; font-size: 13px; margin: 6px 0 0;\">Available for private label today</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0;\">50+</p>\n      <p style=\"color: white; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 14px 0 0;\">Years experience</p>\n      <p style=\"color: white; opacity: .7; font-size: 13px; margin: 6px 0 0;\">In dietary supplement manufacturing</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207762479,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">WHAT YOU OWN VS WHAT WE OWN</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Clear ownership at every step, so nothing falls through the cracks.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">You own the brand, the audience, the marketing, and the customer relationship. We own the formulation, manufacturing, quality, compliance, and fulfillment. Both teams stay in their lane, and the lines are explicit from week 1.</p>\n    </div><div><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_BuildSuppBrand.jpg\" alt=\"Brand and manufacturing ownership\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207762480,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to start the process?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a discovery call. We will walk through your concept, recommend the right formulations, and give you a realistic timeline to launch.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Discovery Call</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207762481,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {},
